        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/085521995d6059208187970031a9e173.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>This is not a loot-grinding RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't become stronger by increasing stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can improve is yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/c1d944671f9e7b461c8fa6c9e2938cc8.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a test of reaction and judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies give you no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake, and you may have to start over.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/340f104feb4e0eb38c01e4b7033250f3.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gear system: victory depends on skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill combos: find your own way to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-pressure combat: face hordes of enemies and survive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/6406d972b598264f108ddffbbc6ce488.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy challenging yourself, not stacking numbers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this might be the Three Kingdoms game you're looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/085521995d6059208187970031a9e173.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>This is not a loot-grinding RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't become stronger by increasing stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can improve is yourself.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/c1d944671f9e7b461c8fa6c9e2938cc8.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a test of reaction and judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies give you no room for error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake, and you may have to start over.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/340f104feb4e0eb38c01e4b7033250f3.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gear system: victory depends on skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill combos: find your own way to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-pressure combat: face hordes of enemies and survive.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/6406d972b598264f108ddffbbc6ce488.avif?t=1778216180\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy challenging yourself, not stacking numbers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this might be the Three Kingdoms game you're looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
